  "project_description": "Entity View Redirect is a simple module that helps to add redirects to the Entities like Node, Taxonomy, and User view page to Edit or custom internal URLs. The advantage of this module is able to skip the View pages for the Drupal core entities. The websites used for Storing content rather than for displaying purposes can use this module.\n\n In some cases, we might use Views to build the pages. In those scenarios, we can use this module to define the path need to redirect.",
